{"purpose":"Validasi gap knowledge sharing EKA: ekstrak project knowledge jadi sharing object tervesioning, terkalsifikasi, bersumber ganda (CKO + audit codebase), akses via CLI+MCP + export/import.","content":"Keputusan Gate2: CLI+MCP dulu, daemon nanti sebagai proyeksi tipis. Sharing object: immutable, standalone, tanpa runtime dependency ke CKO sumber (snapshot copy + provenance link derives-from untuk traceability, bukan depends-on live). Identity sendiri: \u003cns\u003e/shr:\u003cid\u003e vN per release project (derives-from rel:X). Bentuk sama untuk EKA-to-EKA (ekstrak CKO) maupun non-EKA (audit codebase); beda hanya provenance: extracted vs audited. Sifat executable-like: bundle mandiri bisa di-list/scan/fetch via CLI+MCP tanpa repo sumber (mirip RSF package + MCP resource title/description). Isi berlapis: L0 high-level (overview, architecture, glossary), L1 mid (modules, flows, decisions), L2 low (API docs, function reference, algorithm, schema). Opt-in per project + depth control; default share nothing.","investigationSummary":"Gate2 refined: CLI+MCP vs daemon dibahas; CLI+MCP menang (deterministik, reuse validate/integrity/ADR-006, tanpa proses baru). Syarat baru user: immutable, independen, versioned, seragam EKA/non-EKA, executable-like, isi high-low docs. Constraints: vision lossless identity-stable; PRD deps searah; ADR-006 lossless/idempotent/konflik reject; ADR-011 immutable content-addressed.","conclusion":"VALIDATED: sharing object model layak masuk roadmap. Bentuk: CKO token shr standalone, snapshot copy + pin hash, derives-from rel, tanpa depends-on live. Skema seragam EKA/non-EKA via provenance extracted/audited. Isi L0-L2, opt-in default-deny, title/description wajib. Akses CLI+MCP dulu; daemon ditunda sebagai proyeksi tipis. Risiko dicatat: token shr = ubah standard; audit non-EKA non-deterministik wajib provenance; scope keduanya-sekaligus berat, rekomendasi kontrak+EKA dulu."}